{"blocks":[{"blockId":"block_023099_8755f6caf4","entityId":"document_16-o023099-caso-6-motor-se-apaga-al-girar","kind":"paragraph","order":23099,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"COMPONENT","sectionPath":["4. Dirección","Dirección mecánica/hidráulica"],"styleId":"","text":"Caso 6 — Motor se apaga al girar","textHash":"8755f6caf4d3e6ec2e48cea47ee65ac4dd2ed0e0fc20966990b23c690c3dedc6"},{"blockId":"block_023100_e401df3494","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":23100,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o023099-caso-6-motor-se-apaga-al-girar","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["4. Dirección","Dirección mecánica/hidráulica"],"styleId":"","text":"Entrada:","textHash":"e401df34940d77269744c377bf21e5c7617c21a324705858e673d2b6def1e1b8"},{"blockId":"block_023101_4f2321ee0c","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":23101,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o023099-caso-6-motor-se-apaga-al-girar","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["4. Dirección","Dirección mecánica/hidráulica"],"styleId":"ListParagraph","text":"Cuando giro el volante completamente, las RPM bajan y el motor casi se apaga.","textHash":"4f2321ee0c92845ecab2b32d2a2e484c1649e67d6e2900ca6ae1d55ca5357e61"},{"blockId":"block_023102_3d11968067","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":23102,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o023099-caso-6-motor-se-apaga-al-girar","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["4. Dirección","Dirección mecánica/hidráulica"],"styleId":"","text":"Respuesta esperada:","textHash":"3d11968067cf434a07aa60101fa7139e49a6535d208624a5e77317c74c05a00f"},{"blockId":"block_023103_dd338f71b5","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":23103,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o023099-caso-6-motor-se-apaga-al-girar","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["4. Dirección","Dirección mecánica/hidráulica"],"styleId":"","text":"1. No mantener el volante contra el tope.","textHash":"dd338f71b54d34344abf75082a02c6bc59e28d5f0962be30d8c7a97b885a2bee"},{"blockId":"block_023104_4771d03c05","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":23104,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o023099-caso-6-motor-se-apaga-al-girar","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["4. Dirección","Dirección mecánica/hidráulica"],"styleId":"","text":"2. Revisar ralentí y estado del motor.","textHash":"4771d03c0551ca88fefae2c5d42f2e270d9e85a3cf7acfaa25c623b3d6c7b038"},{"blockId":"block_023105_60d817088f","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":23105,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o023099-caso-6-motor-se-apaga-al-girar","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["4. Dirección","Dirección mecánica/hidráulica"],"styleId":"","text":"3. Revisar nivel y aire en PSF.","textHash":"60d817088fdbed253ed3d8952fc45241ce14538b017991d118c38a5a1cf07e48"},{"blockId":"block_023106_4717340314","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":23106,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o023099-caso-6-motor-se-apaga-al-girar","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["4. Dirección","Dirección mecánica/hidráulica"],"styleId":"","text":"4. Revisar presión excesiva o válvula trabada.","textHash":"47173403149d9a58d1eec628335a600eabd5ef6e9ae9d66803c6189a2afeaf59"},{"blockId":"block_023107_bbcdb47c80","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":23107,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o023099-caso-6-motor-se-apaga-al-girar","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["4. Dirección","Dirección mecánica/hidráulica"],"styleId":"","text":"5. Confirmar si equipa switch de presión.","textHash":"bbcdb47c800c23f9183d9e736eedb8e4e96e4d80c46c677b04bf84338a8ac0dd"},{"blockId":"block_023108_90630de418","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":23108,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o023099-caso-6-motor-se-apaga-al-girar","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["4. Dirección","Dirección mecánica/hidráulica"],"styleId":"","text":"6. Revisar señal y cableado del switch.","textHash":"90630de418fce8b3fb8f40104eefc936a157b39167a9c5105c9b5e827ed50fed"},{"blockId":"block_023109_9dd65616e7","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":23109,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o023099-caso-6-motor-se-apaga-al-girar","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["4. Dirección","Dirección mecánica/hidráulica"],"styleId":"","text":"7. Revisar bomba únicamente después de medir presión.","textHash":"9dd65616e7fd3be50e94a8974728790192d45ce5c2855a0be9dafff2b6db448c"},{"blockId":"block_023110_e4a27a7d8f","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":23110,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o023099-caso-6-motor-se-apaga-al-girar","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["4. Dirección","Dirección mecánica/hidráulica"],"styleId":"","text":"Una IA técnica debe separar correctamente fallas mecánicas, hidráulicas, eléctricas, de suspensión y de alineación antes de condenar la bomba o la cremallera.","textHash":"e4a27a7d8fd31d9238004be2deaacf83bc21201585265e7f776eb436c42cf541"}],"contentSha256":"edb889cfcfed7c911a2967e3eb0d63247a9f37d06360281b115395ddaddfc3a2","corpusId":"meet_owner_proprietary_parts_corpus","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"document_16-steering-o023099-4-direccion-direccion-mecanica-hidraulica","sourceDocumentId":"document_16","sourceDocumentSha256":"09f2926a22542a4e7be24e50f2a4f4c42674f32958e8e541683fbb0cf76352d7","sourceFileName":"Document (16).docx","systemId":"steering","titleOriginal":"4. Dirección · Dirección mecánica/hidráulica","vehicleLabel":"Hyundai Accent/Verna 2005 · caja automática · motor 1600 cc"}
